name stepgreek
category Package
revision 57074
shortdesc A free Times/Elsevier-style Greek font
longdesc This is a beta version of the STEP Greek font. Only a regular
longdesc face is available at present, though there are plans to add
longdesc italic, bold and bold italic in the future. The font only
longdesc supports LGR in TeX and is meant to serve as a Greek complement
longdesc to a Times-like font such as STEP. The font supports polytonic
longdesc Greek.
